      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Southern Border’s Paradise Earth true inheritance describes the ten earths in detail and states that they can bear the task of being earth vein nodes. Earth Cave is not among the five Fang Yuan can create while he builds an artificial earth vein; those are Earth Abyss, Earth Trench, Earth Tunnel, Production Earth, and Formation Earth, and the other five are beyond his ability at that point.",
